WEBVTT

00:11:30.286 --> 00:11:32.311
And what are you going to say?

00:11:32.335 --> 00:11:33.977
You know what you're going to say?

00:11:34.001 --> 00:11:36.507
"Look kid. I had a dream once, too, but --

00:11:38.595 --> 00:11:39.769
But --"

00:11:39.793 --> 00:11:42.693
So how are you going to finish
the sentence with your "but"?

00:11:42.717 --> 00:11:47.998
"But. I had a dream too, once,
kid, but I was afraid to pursue it."

00:11:48.781 --> 00:11:51.360
Or are you going to tell him this:

00:11:51.384 --> 00:11:53.036
"I had a dream once, kid.

00:11:55.161 --> 00:11:56.703
But then, you were born."

00:11:56.727 --> 00:11:59.037
(Laughter)

00:11:59.061 --> 00:12:01.703
(Applause)